{"id": "msg_814e9b5636d6429bbee1b8909b2a8dcf", "role": "assistant", "parts": [{"type": "text", "text": "按你的习惯，先提交并推送到远程，再回写禅道。先看提交规范和工作区状态。"}, {"type": "tool", "tool_id": "call_cursor_5184fe6f630cdd8fdd3773bd_0_0", "tool_name": "mcp__openviking__read", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "running", "tool_input": {"uris": ["viking://user/default/memories/preferences/default/git提交工作流.md", "viking://user/default/memories/preferences/suzhufang_developer/git_branch_strategy.md"], "limit": 120}}, {"type": "tool", "tool_id": "call_cursor_5184fe6f630cdd8fdd3773bd_0_1", "tool_name": "pwsh", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "running", "tool_input": {"description": "Inspect git status, diff, log", "command": "git status --short; git diff --stat; git log --oneline -6; git rev-parse --abbrev-ref HEAD; git status -sb", "workdir": "D:\\repository\\苏住房防汛C端"}}], "created_at": "2026-11-10T03:26:13.142Z", "peer_id": "gitlab.zhi.com-zhi-suzhou-shiqu-suzhufang-fe-zhi2-mobile-query-h5-c-unlimited"}
{"id": "msg_84a5046df07b404494f3ea77952c286c", "role": "user", "parts": [{"type": "tool", "tool_id": "call_cursor_5184fe6f630cdd8fdd3773bd_0_0", "tool_name": "mcp__openviking__read", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "completed", "tool_output": "[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"=== viking://user/default/memories/preferences/default/git提交工作流.md ===\\n- 提交时若 husky 钩子退出码为 1，先 git log -1 --oneline + git show --stat HEAD 核实提交对象是否已落地、内容是否只含本次目标文件，内容完整就不要再提交\\n- 提交必须按具体路径暂存（不要 git add .），避免纳入别人正在改的文件\\n- 两层仓库都提交：子模块先行、父仓只更新 gitlink 指针，核对父仓指针与子模块 HEAD 一致、两层与远程 0/0 同步\\n- 构建产生的 public/version.json 不纳入提交\\n- 每笔提交都过 lint-staged 钩子，中文提交信息确保无乱码\\n\\n=== viking://user/default/memories/preferences/suzhufang_developer/git_branch_strategy.md ===\\n- When a remote branch already exists with real feature work, keeps it as the source of truth and aligns the local branch to it instead of force-pushing a locally created branch that would roll back submodule pointers.\"}]", "tool_output_group_id": "msg_84a5046df07b404494f3ea77952c286c", "tool_output_group_original_chars": 699, "tool_output_group_budget_chars": 100000}], "created_at": "2026-11-10T03:26:13.178Z", "peer_id": "gitlab.zhi.com-zhi-suzhou-shiqu-suzhufang-fe-zhi2-mobile-query-h5-c-unlimited"}
